<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Journey</span>
        <h1>Two decades of change — one steady partner</h1>
        <p>Business ICT Australia is an Information &amp; Communications Technology company focused on providing best-in-class unified communications, managed networks, mobility, and IT services for Australian enterprises.</p>
        <p>We're a local team helping Australian small and medium businesses stay connected, protected, and productive.</p>
        <p>Australian telecommunications has moved fast since 2005 — from copper and 3G to fibre, 5G and cloud. Here's how that industry shifted, alongside how Business ICT grew to meet it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline" data-reveal>

  <div class="timeline__row">
    <div class="timeline__node">
      <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
      <span class="timeline__year">2005</span>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline__side">
      <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
        <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
        <h3>The telco dealership begins</h3>
        <p>Our roots start here, in a telco dealership — the foundation everything else was built on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline__row">
    <div class="timeline__node">
      <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
      <span class="timeline__year">2015</span>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline__side">
      <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
        <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
        <h3>Business ICT is born</h3>
        <p>The dealership evolves into Business ICT Australia — a dedicated ICT solutions provider for Melbourne SMBs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline__row">
    <div class="timeline__node">
      <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
      <span class="timeline__year">2021</span>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline__side">
      <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
        <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
        <h3>A new home in Mount Waverley</h3>
        <p>Business ICT moves into its Mount Waverley office.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline__row">
    <div class="timeline__node">
      <span class="timeline__dot"></span>
      <span class="timeline__year">Today</span>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline__side">
      <div class="timeline-card timeline-card--business">
        <span class="timeline-card__eyebrow">Business ICT</span>
        <h3>A full-stack Melbourne MSP</h3>
        <p>Telstra Wholesale mobiles, Cisco Meraki networking, Kyocera print, Yealink voice, and NBN &amp; fibre connectivity — one accountable local partner.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

